            "locator": "slide:45/shape:790",
            "quote": "\t20 paket"
          },
          {
            "locator": "slide:45/shape:791",
            "quote": "\tTanpa urutan dan tanpa memilih lauk sama berulang: C(6,3) = 6!/(3!3!) = 20."
          },
          {
